stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Created: PurchaseListing succeeds\n(InventoryUnit reserved atomically, AD-6)

  Created --> BuyerPaid: buyer uploads comprobante\nand confirms (buyerPaidConfirmedAt set)
  BuyerPaid --> SellerReceived: business independently\nconfirms (sellerReceivedConfirmedAt set)
  SellerReceived --> ItemReceived: buyer confirms item\nreceived (buyerItemReceivedConfirmedAt set)

  ItemReceived --> [*]: Order closed\n(only state that closes the order, AD-2)

  note right of Created
    No payment gateway integration and no
    "funds held" state at any point (AD-2).
    Inventory is already decremented here,
    at reservation time, not at close.
  end note

  note right of SellerReceived
    CommissionBalanceExhausted/Replenished
    (AD-3) reacts to this transition via an
    in-process domain event, not a direct call.
  end note

  note right of ItemReceived
    Triggers a dismissible add-to-collection
    prompt (CAP-27) - never an automatic
    CollectionEntry write.
  end note
